        "original_id": "6c05d58a-b242-54ca-a0a3-193b9c867ca3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Teams: 1998 West Virginia Mountaineers football team; 1998 Missouri Tigers football team\n- Organizations: West Virginia University; Big East Conference\n- Events: 1998 NCAA Division I-A football season; Insight.com Bowl\n- Places: Tucson\n\nFacts:\n- The 1998 West Virginia Mountaineers football team represented West Virginia University in the 1998 NCAA Division I-A football season.\n- The 1998 season was the 106th overall season for the West Virginia Mountaineers football team and their 8th season as a member of the Big East Conference.\n- The Big East Conference was a collegiate athletics conference that included as many as 16 universities in the eastern half of the United States from 1979 to 2013.\n- The 1998 Missouri Tigers football team finished with an 8-4 overall record and a 5-3 conference record.\n- The 1998 Missouri Tigers football team defeated West Virginia 34-31 in the Insight.com Bowl at Tucson.",
